{"seq":2,"slug":"constrained-decoding-basics","title":"约束解码基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/constrained-decoding-basics","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束解码基础\">约束解码基础</h1><p>约束解码听上去高深，拆开看只是在一个本来就存在的循环里插了一脚。自回归模型本来每一步就要从词表里&quot;选一个 token&quot;，约束解码做的全部事情，是在它选之前划掉一批&quot;此刻不许选&quot;的候选。理解了这个介入点，后面所有 FSM、CFG、Schema 的复杂度都只是同一件事的不同算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>约束解码拆开看只是在自回归采样的内循环里插了一脚：模型每一步本就要从词表里选一个 token，约束做的事是在它选之前划掉&quot;此刻不许选&quot;的候选。全部复杂度都集中在&quot;怎么算这批候选&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S[&quot;自回归采样内循环&quot;] --&gt; Z[&quot;前向得到 logit 向量 z&quot;]&#10;    Z --&gt; M[&quot;约束器按当前状态算掩码 m&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; N[&quot;不合法 token 的 logit 置 -inf&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; P[&quot;softmax 后其概率严格为 0&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; A[&quot;采样并追加新 token&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; T[&quot;约束器推进状态&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; Z\">graph TD\n    S[\"自回归采样内循环\"] --&gt; Z[\"前向得到 logit 向量 z\"]\n    Z --&gt; M[\"约束器按当前状态算掩码 m\"]\n    M --&gt; N[\"不合法 token 的 logit 置 -inf\"]\n    N --&gt; P[\"softmax 后其概率严格为 0\"]\n    P --&gt; A[\"采样并追加新 token\"]\n    A --&gt; T[\"约束器推进状态\"]\n    T --&gt; Z</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>介入点</strong>：logit 算出之后、采样发生之前；被掩码的 token 概率严格为零，与温度无关。</li>\n<li><strong>数学极简</strong>：不合法 token 的 logit 置负无穷，合法性成为解码不变式而非模型意图。</li>\n<li><strong>工程难点</strong>：对全词表快速判断&quot;每个 token 接上后前缀是否仍可能是合法结构的前缀&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>token 层与字符层错位</strong>：约束规约定义在字符上、采样发生在 token 上，token 化歧义是反复出现的麻烦源。</li>\n<li><strong>状态是关键优化</strong>：掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖当前状态，可离线预计算成位图，运行时退化为查表。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自回归采样的内循环\">自回归采样的内循环</h2><p>一个 LLM 生成文本是逐 token 的：给定已生成的前缀，模型前向一次，输出一个长度等于词表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 的 logit 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{|V|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 通常在 5 万到 25 万之间——比如 Llama 系列约 12.8 万，GPT-4 系列超过 20 万。logit 经过 softmax 变成概率分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = \\frac{e^{z_i / T}}{\\sum_{j} e^{z_j / T}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7209em;vertical-align:-1.1559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2799em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8301em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度。然后按某种采样策略（贪心、top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、温度采样）从这个分布里抽一个 token，追加到前缀，再循环。这个循环的关键观察是：<strong>每一步都是一次在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 上的离散选择</strong>——这正是约束可以介入的缝隙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掩码-采样循环\">掩码—采样循环</h2><p>约束解码在 logit 算出之后、采样发生之前插入一步：对每个 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 计算一个布尔掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示当前状态下合法），然后把不合法 token 的 logit 压成负无穷：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_i&#x27; = \\begin{cases} z_i &amp; m_i = 1 \\\\ -\\infty &amp; m_i = 0 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经过 softmax 后，被掩码的 token 概率严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，无论温度多高、采样多随机都不可能被选中。这就是约束的全部数学。下图是带约束的解码循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[已生成前缀] --&gt; B[模型前向&lt;br/&gt;得到 logit z]&#10;    B --&gt; C[约束器: 看当前语法状态&lt;br/&gt;计算掩码 m]&#10;    C --&gt; D[z_i 置 -inf&lt;br/&gt;对所有 m_i=0]&#10;    D --&gt; E[softmax + 采样]&#10;    E --&gt; F[追加新 token]&#10;    F --&gt; G[约束器推进状态]&#10;    G --&gt; H{结束?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| A&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[输出合法结构]\">flowchart TD\n    A[已生成前缀] --&gt; B[模型前向&lt;br/&gt;得到 logit z]\n    B --&gt; C[约束器: 看当前语法状态&lt;br/&gt;计算掩码 m]\n    C --&gt; D[z_i 置 -inf&lt;br/&gt;对所有 m_i=0]\n    D --&gt; E[softmax + 采样]\n    E --&gt; F[追加新 token]\n    F --&gt; G[约束器推进状态]\n    G --&gt; H{结束?}\n    H --&gt;|否| A\n    H --&gt;|是| I[输出合法结构]</pre><p>注意循环里多出的两个约束器动作：<strong>算掩码</strong>（步骤 C）和<strong>推进状态</strong>（步骤 G）。整个工程的难点都集中在第一个动作——如何在每一步、对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，快速判断&quot;接上这个 token 后前缀是否仍可能成为合法结构的前缀&quot;。不同机制的性能差异，本质都是这一步的算法差异，详见 <a href=\"../mechanisms/logit-masking-fsm\">logit 掩码与有限状态机</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词表与分词的麻烦\">词表与分词的麻烦</h2><p>约束规约通常定义在<strong>字符</strong>层面（正则、文法都是描述字符串的），但模型采样是在<strong>token</strong>层面。一个 token 可能是多个字符（<code> true</code>、<code>&quot;:</code> 甚至 <code>&quot;: &quot;</code>），也可能把一个语义单元切成几片。这导致约束器必须回答的不是&quot;下一个字符能否是 <code>x</code>&quot;，而是&quot;下一个 token（一串字符）整体接上去后是否仍合法&quot;。下表对照两个层面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>字符层面（约束定义）</th>\n<th>token 层面（采样发生）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本单位</td>\n<td>单个字符</td>\n<td>词表里的 token（≥1 字符）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量级</td>\n<td>几十到几百（字母表）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>∼</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{万} \\sim 25\\text{万}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束如何表达</td>\n<td>正则 / 文法直接定义</td>\n<td>需把字符级约束&quot;翻译&quot;到 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>棘手点</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>token 边界与字符边界不对齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最经典的坑是 <strong>token 化歧义</strong>：合法字符串 <code>true</code> 在词表里可能既能被单 token <code> true</code> 表示，也能被 <code> tr</code>+<code>ue</code> 两个 token 拼出。约束器必须接受所有能拼出合法字符串的 token 路径，否则会无谓地砍掉模型本可走的路、扭曲分布。这个问题在 <a href=\"../practice/reliability-failure-modes\">可靠性与失效模式</a> 里会作为一类失效模式再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机-约束器的记忆\">状态机：约束器的记忆</h2><p>约束器要在每一步知道&quot;我现在允许什么&quot;，就必须维护一个<strong>状态</strong>。对正则类约束，状态是有限状态机的当前节点；对文法类约束，状态是下推自动机的栈或 Earley 解析器的项集。每采样一个 token，约束器据此推进状态（步骤 G），下一步再用新状态算掩码。</p>\n<p>这带来一个工程优化的核心思路：掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖<strong>当前状态</strong>，而状态总数往往有限。于是可以<strong>预计算</strong>——离线把每个状态对应的合法 token 集合算好缓存成位图，运行时从查表退化为一次查询，每 token 开销可压到微秒级。这正是 Outlines 早期的核心技巧，也是为什么不同库的&quot;编译时 vs 运行时&quot;取舍差异巨大，详见 <a href=\"../systems/library-landscape\">库与引擎格局</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>约束解码的介入点是自回归采样内循环里&quot;算完 logit、采样之前&quot;那一步。</li>\n<li>数学极简：给不合法 token 的 logit 置负无穷，使其概率严格为零。</li>\n<li>工程难点在&quot;算掩码&quot;：对全词表快速判断每个 token 接上后是否仍合法。</li>\n<li>字符层约束与 token 层采样的错位（token 化歧义）是反复出现的麻烦源。</li>\n<li>约束器靠状态机维护&quot;当前允许什么&quot;，状态有限使得预计算掩码成为关键优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>掩码的具体算法（正则→FSM）：<a href=\"../mechanisms/logit-masking-fsm\">logit 掩码与有限状态机</a></li>\n<li>为什么要分两条路线表达约束：<a href=\"grammar-vs-schema\">语法与模式两条路线</a></li>\n<li>预计算与运行时的取舍体现在选型上：<a href=\"../systems/library-landscape\">库与引擎格局</a></li>\n<li>跨库：自回归采样、温度、top-p 的基础见 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/decoding-bottlenecks\">LLM 基础 · 解码瓶颈</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束解码基础","id":"约束解码基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自回归采样的内循环","id":"自回归采样的内循环"},{"level":2,"text":"掩码—采样循环","id":"掩码-采样循环"},{"level":2,"text":"词表与分词的麻烦","id":"词表与分词的麻烦"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机：约束器的记忆","id":"状态机-约束器的记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要结构化输出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/why-structured-output"},"next":{"title":"语法与模式两条路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/grammar-vs-schema"}}